                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a6f1ee0d-b9ba-3d54-8d2e-cd2064bd8fd3",
                        "entry_id": "558fc5bb-6d66-3065-b3ec-fe6560ee5f2c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "vent; outlet; airhole; air valve"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa61e7f4-b74c-4fd9-9ddd-7c13ab49d6d3",
                                "sense_id": "a6f1ee0d-b9ba-3d54-8d2e-cd2064bd8fd3",
                                "text": "Огро́мная печь была́ похо́жа на уро́дливую го́лову ска́зочного чудо́вища, — она́ как бы вы́сунулась из-под по́ла, откры́ла широ́кую пасть, по́лную я́ркого огня́, дыша́ла на нас жа́ром и смотре́ла на бесконе́чную рабо́ту на́шу двумя́ чё́рными впа́динами отду́шин над чело́м.",
                                "translation": "The huge oven looked like the deformed head of a fairy-tale monster. It looked as though it thrust itself out from underneath the floor, opened its wide mouth full of fire, and breathed on us with heat and stared at our endless work through the two black air-holes above the forehead.",
                                "english": "The huge oven looked like the deformed head of a fairy-tale monster. It looked as though it thrust itself out from underneath the floor, opened its wide mouth full of fire, and breathed on us with heat and stared at our endless work through the two black air-holes above the forehead."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
